<section class="three-tool-knowledge" id="chart-deep-guide" aria-labelledby="chart-deep-heading">
<h2 id="chart-deep-heading">Printable Salah chart: free 7, 14 and 30-day prayer checklist guide</h2>
<p><strong>Short answer:</strong> A Salah chart is a personal paper or PDF checklist with a row for each civil day and columns for the five daily obligatory prayers. Choose a 7-, 14- or 30-day period, print the blank table or export it as a CSV. A blank square means <strong>not recorded</strong>; it does not prove that worship was missed.</p>
